00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,160
Catch up!

296
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,440
I'm here!

297
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,360
All right, let's welcome

298
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,000
Ms. Huang Sami.

299
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,040
Hi, everyone.

300
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:28,760
I'm Sami.

301
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,400
I'm a psychology researcher.

302
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:34,000
I'm here

303
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,800
(Expert: Sami Huang, CGTN Psychologist)
to help

304
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:37,000
(Clinical psychotherapist)
go a little deeper

305
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,560
(Cross-cultural researcher)
and unpack

306
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,480
