307
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,640
I love Sami.

308
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:45,480
Looks like more people are coming.

309
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:46,680
(More guests?)

310
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:47,840
Who's here?

311
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:52,180
