312
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,360
Hi!

313
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:54,880
I can smell romance.

314
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:55,680
I smell it.

315
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:59,040
(What a surprise!)
Aren't they the newlyweds?

316
00:08:59,620 --> 00:09:00,740
(Excited)

317
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,720
Hello.

318
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:05,040
(Too much happiness)
I love these two.

319
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:05,440
I know.

320
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,440
They're here.

321
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,720
I'm already swooning.

322
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,440
(Can't handle it)
You'll sit next to them.

323
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,400
Seriously?

324
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:10,960
Relax.

325
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,440
Sami, long time no see.

326
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,480
Long time no see.

327
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,520
Congratulations.

328
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,160
Hi, Chaoyue.

329
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,280
Hi.

330
00:09:16,340 --> 00:09:18,280
(Waiting anxiously)

331
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,080
Congratulations.

332
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,440
Thank you.

333
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,040
Thanks for the sweets.

334
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:20,640
Thank you.

335
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:22,620
(Sticking close)

336
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,160
Thank you. So sweet.

337
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:26,660
(Quietly waiting)

338
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,440
Here, Haitao.

339
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,960
Everyone got one of these.

340
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,200
They're engagement treats.

341
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,480
(Engagement favors)
You didn't have to.

342
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:34,800
I said to save mine for inside.

343
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,280
We wanted to share them.

344
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,560
They're...

345
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:38,760
Engagement favors.

346
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,800
And we wanted to share

347
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,600
some of our happiness

348
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,360
(Sharing the joy)
with everyone here.

349
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,280
Thank you.

350
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,600
We hope everyone finds

351
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,080
a sweet love of their own.

352
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,600
Thank you.

353
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,480
Dai Xu.

354
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,440
(Is it finally my turn?)
Hello.

355
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:55,000
(Nervous)
Hello, Dai Xu.

356
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,280
Dai Xu is nervous.

357
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,600
(Finding the words)

358
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,080
I brought you something else.

359
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,360
(What?)
What is it?

360
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:02,920
For you.

361
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,680
Two cards again,

362
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,000
