363
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,040
(Iconic moment)
They're all yours.

364
00:10:10,300 --> 00:10:11,160
(Veteran shipper)

365
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,040
They're all yours!

366
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,680
I should be looking up at 45 degrees.

367
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,280
No, rub your forehead.

368
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,760
(Season 6)
These two cards

369
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,600
and my photo

370
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,040
are all yours.

371
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:31,140
(Shy and smiles)

372
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:34,670
(Longtime fan)
All yours.

373
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:35,960
(Fully invested)
They're all yours.

374
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,560
Have a seat.

375
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:39,320
You're so into this.

376
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,080
Yeah. They're all yours.

377
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,600
There's a gesture too.

378
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,800
Yeah, the gesture too.

379
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:44,840
Watching

380
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,880
