381
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:47,720
I can't stop smiling.

382
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:50,160
What's that called?
Proud... relative smile?

383
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:50,800
A proud-family smile.

384
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,160
Right, a proud-family smile.

385
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,320
(Back with family)
Feels like family.

386
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,480
(Holding it together)
I have to try not to grin.

387
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:54,920
You know?

388
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,960
So, where are you two now?

389
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,480
Right now...

390
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,400
We got engaged in late May.

391
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,160
We're registering our marriage
in early October.

392
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,000
The date's set.

393
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:07,940
(Excited)

394
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,480
When Hou Zhuocheng shared

395
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,160
