396
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:15,560
"Hou Zhuocheng proposes to Yang Ruqing"

397
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,600
went straight

398
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,080
to No. 1

399
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,400
on Weibo's trending list.

400
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,800
May you be together forever.

401
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,000
That's wonderful.

402
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:35,280
Those tears were worth it.

403
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:35,960
Seriously.

404
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,200
My first plan

405
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:39,280
was to propose in Yunnan

406
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:40,640
or maybe Hainan.

407
00:11:40,940 --> 00:11:41,920
(Listening closely)

408
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,000
Somewhere beautiful.

409
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,480
(Visibility: 30%)
Yeah, somewhere beautiful.

410
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:47,680
I asked her

411
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,480
what kind of proposal

412
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:48,960
she would want.

413
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,120
You asked her?

414
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:51,060
(Visibility: 0%)

415
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:55,560
We talked about it.

416
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,280
You can do that?

417
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,520
Wait.

418
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:58,800
Can I cut in for a second?

419
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,160
(I have to say this)
Dai Xu is locked in.

420
00:12:02,160 --> 00:12:02,440
He...

421
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:05,580
(Front-row shipping)

422
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:06,900
(Perfectly blocked)

423
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,400
Sorry, I'm blocking you.

424
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:11,440
With you sitting there,

425
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,200
I'd have to stand on the table.

426
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:14,840
I'm sorry.

427
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:19,360
Go on.

428
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:20,200
I asked her

429
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,200
what kind of proposal she would want.

430
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,280
She said she wants it

431
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,120
to be beautiful

432
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,400
and full of surprise.

433
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:26,200
So, I thought

434
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:26,640
we could go

435
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:27,760
to the Season 6 house.

436
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:29,560
But when I asked,

437
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,080
it'd been demolished.

438
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,560
Too bad.

439
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:32,360
Then I thought

440
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,360
the final confession spot

441
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:33,920
could work too.

442
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,520
I figured

443
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:36,840
Season 9 would be too busy

444
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,520
and they'd have no time

445
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,080
to help me.

446
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,040
Filming was about to start.

447
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:40,040
But the day I proposed

448
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:40,840
happened to be

449
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,280
the day

450
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,240
before Season 9 started filming.

451
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:44,880
That's a good sign too.

452
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:46,040
Nine also represents lasting love.

453
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:46,880
Exactly.

454
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,920
At first,

455
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:49,000
I told her there'd be

456
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,600
a Season 9

457
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,120
sports day.

458
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,760
She said,

459
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:51,840
I'm wearing workout clothes.

460
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,480
(Quick save)
I was like no, no.

461
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,360
It's more of a dinner.

462
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,640
Wear a dress.

463
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,200
But that day,

464
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,240
a lot felt strange.

465
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,800
For example, the makeup artist

466
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,120
spent 3.5 hours on me.

467
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:04,920
I remember thinking,

468
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:05,480
why is my makeup

469
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,200
taking so long?

470
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,600
I thought it was weird.

471
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,400
And the dress that day

472
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,560
(Guest Cupid: Yang Ruqing)
was more formal too.

473
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,400
It was a pink tulle gown.

474
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,400
There were so many times

475
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:14,520
we almost

476
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:15,400
gave it away.

477
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:16,720
Whenever that happened,

478
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,240
we'd quickly cover it up.

479
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:21,720
When he took you to the spot,

480
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:22,320
did you know

481
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,080
he'd propose?

482
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:24,720
Were you...

483
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:25,680
(Curious)
Did you know?

484
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,240
(Curiosity activated)
No idea.

485
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,680
So when he said it was just

486
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:29,000
for show,

487
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,360
I totally

488
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,200
let my guard down.

489
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,280
That's a good trick.

490
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:33,880
Yeah.

491
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:34,520
Right.

492
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:35,760
But I have a question.

493
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:37,600
How'd you feel afterward?

494
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,480
Because

495
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,280
that is a huge life moment.

496
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,000
So both people

497
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,520
want it

498
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,880
to feel right for both.

499
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,920
At first, it feels

500
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:47,720
like a huge milestone.

501
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:49,160
Then you realize

502
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,360
you're still with the same person,

503
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,880
building a life together.

504
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:53,120
Day to day, it's the same.

505
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,640
But now there's...

506
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:55,400
more responsibility.

507
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:56,640
When I said

508
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,320
yes,

509
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,840
I wasn't just saying yes

510
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,600
to marrying him.

511
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,200
It's not just on him.

512
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:02,920
I also

513
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,280
have responsibility for his life too.

514
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:05,960
Right.

515
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,080
From then on,

516
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,280
whatever we face,

517
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,160
the good and the bad,

518
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:11,520
we face it together.

519
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:12,960
That responsibility

520
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,360
does make me nervous.

521
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:16,440
But it also makes me feel...

522
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,840
We'll always catch each other.

523
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:21,260
(That hit hard)

524
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,600
(Shipping hard)
Love it.

525
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:24,600
Now, you're not alone.

526
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,640
There are two of you.

527
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,400
Beautifully said.

528
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,080
People call you

529
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,640
the total sapiosexual.

530
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,040
You've earned that label.

531
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:34,120
That "sapiosexual" label

532
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:34,800
probably makes people think

533
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:35,840
our everyday life

534
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,040
is full of things

535
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:37,720
like deep talks

536
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,960
or maybe

537
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,640
watching thought-provoking movies

538
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:41,320
and talking philosophy.

539
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,080
Not really.

540
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:43,520
For us,

541
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:45,240
it's about being real.

542
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,840
(Sincerity)
Be sincere,

543
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,840
(Real feelings)
be real,

544
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,080
(Cherish each other)
and cherish each other.

545
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:49,840
Even

546
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,040
in the little everyday things,

547
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:52,880
we try to make life

548
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:54,240
a bit happier.

549
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,320
It doesn't have to be romantic.

550
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,120
In real life,

551
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,840
building a good life together

552
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:58,920
is what takes

553
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,160
wisdom and understanding.

554
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:01,400
Yang Ruqing,

555
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,000
we'd better remember

556
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,280
(Taking notes)
all that.

557
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,600
I've got it.

558
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,480
I'll quiz you later.

559
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Now,

560
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,640
you're back in the studio.

561
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:11,360
What does it feel

562
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,480
this time?

563
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,960
Honestly, coming back here

564
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,840
makes me feel

565
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,160
(Star graduate)
like a star student returning.

566
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:21,040
When we joined

567
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:21,640
Season 6,

568
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:22,680
we were the students.

569
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:23,200
And by the end,

570
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:23,760
we had chosen

571
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:24,520
each other.

572
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:25,840
So in a way,

573
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,640
we graduated

574
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:27,400
from Heart Signal

575
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,200
together.

576
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:28,760
Then came

577
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:31,000
the real-life part.

578
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,680
For the past three years,

579
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:33,560
we've been happy together.

580
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:35,000
And I think

581
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:35,920
in real life,

582
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:37,640
we've done pretty well too.

583
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,200
So now,

584
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,160
coming back here

585
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:40,680
does feel

586
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,120
a little

587
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:42,720
like we're...

588
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:43,880
the star graduates.

589
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:46,160
Hou Zhuocheng, you've changed.

590
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:46,560
Seriously.

591
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,160
