For phrase

889
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:58,360
like "I ship them" or "So sweet",

890
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,480
what should we say instead?

891
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:01,080
"No".

892
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:04,000
Just "No".

893
00:23:05,280 --> 00:23:06,040
I think the point

894
00:23:06,040 --> 00:23:07,880
is not to use one little phrase

895
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:09,960
to flatten the whole journey.

896
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,040
Maybe we can

897
00:23:11,040 --> 00:23:12,360
use fewer buzzwords

898
00:23:12,360 --> 00:23:13,640
and say what we mean.

899
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:14,640
(Makes sense)

900
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:15,760
That gives it more substance.

901
00:23:15,760 --> 00:23:16,680
Name one detail,

902
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:17,680
then add how you felt.

903
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,080
I think, deep down,

904
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:19,520
what

905
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:20,320
our viewers

906
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:21,640
really want is for us

907
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:23,760
to get more into it

908
00:23:23,760 --> 00:23:24,840
and express ourselves

909
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:25,600
with more depth.

910
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:27,480
So, phrases like "So sweet",

911
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,520
"I ship them",

912
00:23:28,520 --> 00:23:29,520
or "Endgame"

913
00:23:29,520 --> 00:23:30,560
aren't necessarily off-limits.

914
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:32,040
We just need to say them

915
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:33,840
with genuine feeling

916
00:23:33,840 --> 00:23:34,880
and have something more to say.

917
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:36,200
(Say something real)
Explain why

918
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,600
based on what we saw and felt.

919
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:39,200
(Be more genuine)
That's a better way to express it.

920
00:23:40,520 --> 00:23:41,640
Anyway, we're listening.

921
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:42,440
Whatever viewers

922
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:43,440
bring up,

923
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,480
we take to heart.

924
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:46,600
All right.

925
00:23:46,600 --> 00:23:47,720
Next,

926
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:48,320
let's get

927
00:23:48,320 --> 00:23:48,840
into our theme

928
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:50,440
this season.

929
00:23:50,860 --> 00:23:51,720
(What's this season's theme?)

930
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,120
Our theme this season

931
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:54,000
is being upfront.

932
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:54,920
Don't drag things out.

933
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:55,880
Don't play games.

934
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:56,600
Be honest and direct.

935
00:23:56,840 --> 00:23:58,120
Say how you feel and go for it.

936
00:23:58,180 --> 00:23:58,920
(Say how you feel)

937
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,120
What does being upfront in love mean

938
00:24:00,120 --> 00:24:01,000
to you?

939
00:24:01,320 --> 00:24:03,240
(Guest Cupid: Hou Zhuocheng)
To me,

940
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,520
being upfront comes down to...

941
00:24:04,520 --> 00:24:05,560
(1. Conscience)
First, have a conscience.

942
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,880
(2. Loyalty)
Second, be loyal.

943
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:09,440
(3. Responsibility)
Third, be responsible.

944
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,520
We've been together three years.

945
00:24:10,520 --> 00:24:11,240
For the first two,

946
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:11,520
we

947
00:24:11,520 --> 00:24:12,680
were renting.

948
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:13,960
And I told her

949
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:14,640
that if we were really

950
00:24:14,640 --> 00:24:15,280
getting married,

951
00:24:15,280 --> 00:24:17,720
we needed a place of our own

952
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,320
so we wouldn't keep moving around.

953
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:20,240
To me, that was also

954
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:21,720
a commitment to each other.

955
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,360
It's like saying clearly,

956
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:25,560
I'm dating to marry.

957
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:26,880
You're putting your intentions out there.

958
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,720
You're clear about what you want.

959
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:29,720
Yeah.

960
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:31,600
To me,

961
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:32,800
being upfront means

962
00:24:32,800 --> 00:24:34,160
being emotionally honest.

963
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,320
Because

964
00:24:35,320 --> 00:24:36,520
it makes communication easier

965
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:37,040
and

966
00:24:37,040 --> 00:24:38,200
there's less second-guessing.

967
00:24:39,040 --> 00:24:40,080
With you,

968
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:40,880
I can be completely open

969
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:42,120
with you.

970
00:24:42,420 --> 00:24:42,960
(Agrees)

971
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:43,360
So

972
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:45,240
it's about being open and honest,

973
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:45,880
hiding nothing,

974
00:24:46,160 --> 00:24:47,680
and making our actions match.

975
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:49,000
That also makes it

976
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:50,080
more comfortable

977
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:51,400
to watch.

978
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:51,720
Yeah.

979
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:52,560
Straightforward.

980
00:24:52,560 --> 00:24:53,160
Upfront.

981
00:24:55,120 --> 00:24:55,680
Actually, we...

982
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,200
Actually, we...

983
00:24:58,020 --> 00:24:58,880
(What's this?)

984
00:24:58,880 --> 00:24:59,840
What's this?

985
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:01,360
Every year,

986
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:02,360
before the show starts,

987
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,040
we do a quick test.

988
00:25:04,100 --> 00:25:05,180
(A little test?)

989
00:25:05,380 --> 00:25:06,500
(Cards coming out)

990
00:25:07,740 --> 00:25:09,100
(Four colored cards)

991
00:25:09,100 --> 00:25:09,760
(What do they mean?)

992
00:25:09,760 --> 00:25:11,200
We've got four cards here,

993
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:13,360
each one a different color.

994
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:13,720
Of course,

995
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,120
we're not choosing

996
00:25:15,120 --> 00:25:16,080
by color.

997
00:25:16,600 --> 00:25:17,440
(No hesitation)
I like blue.

998
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,800
I like purple.

999
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,480
We need

1000
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:22,880
to look at what each one says.

1001
00:25:23,320 --> 00:25:24,480
We have...

1002
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:26,560
Empathetic Love,

1003
00:25:26,560 --> 00:25:28,040
where they have your back.

1004
00:25:28,040 --> 00:25:29,640
Then there's Independent Love,

1005
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:30,880
where you have your space

1006
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,120
and I have mine.

1007
00:25:32,120 --> 00:25:33,920
Next is Secure Love,

1008
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:35,560
with steady reassurance.

1009
00:25:35,560 --> 00:25:37,360
And last, Passionate Love,

1010
00:25:37,360 --> 00:25:38,200
where you feel

1011
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:39,160
that instant sparks.

1012
00:25:39,380 --> 00:25:40,260
(Got it)

1013
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:42,280
I want everyone

1014
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,440
to go

1015
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:45,560
with your gut instinct

1016
00:25:45,560 --> 00:25:47,040
and pick the love model

1017
00:25:47,040 --> 00:25:48,120
you want most.

1018
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:49,320
Can we pick two?

1019
00:25:49,320 --> 00:25:50,120
(Quick question)

1020
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:51,120
Yes.

1021
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:52,920
Pick a first and second choice.

1022
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:55,480
I think your choice

1023
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,640
can change over time.

1024
00:25:56,640 --> 00:25:57,240
Right.

1025
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:58,840
It's not fixed forever.

1026
00:25:58,840 --> 00:25:59,680
It's more

1027
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:00,600
like different stages.

1028
00:26:00,600 --> 00:26:02,040
The beginning, the middle,

1029
00:26:02,040 --> 00:26:02,480
and so on.

1030
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:03,000
Exactly.

1031
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:03,920
So for now, let's choose

1032
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:04,800
(Top choice)
the one we want most.

1033
00:26:05,360 --> 00:26:05,760
Okay.

1034
00:26:06,020 --> 00:26:07,040
(What will everyone choose?)

1035
00:26:07,040 --> 00:26:08,800
I picked this one instantly

1036
00:26:08,800 --> 00:26:10,280
(Zhang Chunye: Passionate Love)
because of one word.

1037
00:26:10,280 --> 00:26:10,840
Energy.

1038
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:14,360
To me, true love

1039
00:26:14,360 --> 00:26:15,600
should feel creative.

1040
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,000
It should

1041
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:18,600
make you feel more alive.

1042
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:19,280
Through that kind of love,

1043
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:20,640
I want to become

1044
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,880
a better version of myself.

1045
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,280
And

1046
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:23,880
for me,

1047
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:25,400
that shouldn't fade after the beginning.

1048
00:26:25,840 --> 00:26:28,200
No matter what stage we're in,

1049
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:29,960
I want that energy to stay.

1050
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:30,600
For a relationship

1051
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:31,840
to last,

1052
00:26:31,840 --> 00:26:32,560
we need

1053
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:33,880
to keep energizing each other.

1054
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:34,720
That also

1055
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:35,400
requires

1056
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:36,400
(Security)
security and commitment,

1057
00:26:36,840 --> 00:26:38,440
(Independence)
independence,

1058
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:40,000
(Support)
empathy and support.

1059
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,360
Only then can we become

1060
00:26:41,360 --> 00:26:42,280
a more vibrant self.

1061
00:26:45,280 --> 00:26:46,360
I picked

1062
00:26:46,360 --> 00:26:47,280
the green one,

1063
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:48,840
independent love.

1064
00:26:49,560 --> 00:26:50,080
Green.

1065
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:53,040
(Yang Chaoyue: Independent Love)
I chose it because...

1066
00:26:54,080 --> 00:26:56,000
I think everyone...

1067
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:57,680
is their own person.

1068
00:26:58,200 --> 00:26:59,120
Right.

1069
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:02,440
We shouldn't pressure each other.

1070
00:27:03,280 --> 00:27:04,280
In love,

1071
00:27:04,280 --> 00:27:05,280
I hope

1072
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:07,120
I don't want to lose myself for love

1073
00:27:07,120 --> 00:27:09,080
or change who I am

1074
00:27:09,080 --> 00:27:11,240
just to blend into their life.

1075
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:12,800
However long

1076
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:14,360
you walk through life with me,

1077
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:16,440
I see it as something meaningful.

1078
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:17,880
I get you.

1079
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:19,720
Same.

1080
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:20,400
Independence

1081
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:20,880
is definitely

1082
00:27:20,880 --> 00:27:21,800
(Fiona Sit: Independent Love)
more important.

1083
00:27:22,360 --> 00:27:24,120
(Same as me)
When I was younger,

1084
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:25,360
I hated being apart.

1085
00:27:25,360 --> 00:27:26,600
But as I've gotten older,

1086
00:27:26,600 --> 00:27:27,360
I've realized

1087
00:27:27,360 --> 00:27:28,120
that

1088
00:27:28,370 --> 00:27:29,090
family,

1089
00:27:29,090 --> 00:27:30,040
work,

1090
00:27:30,040 --> 00:27:30,840
friends,

1091
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:32,120
and simply

1092
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:33,960
enjoying life all matters too.

1093
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:36,480
You need

1094
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:39,000
balance within yourself.

1095
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:42,880
The person you marry,

1096
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:43,560
the best in them,

1097
00:27:43,560 --> 00:27:45,920
should bring out your best self.

1098
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:47,720
When you're together,

1099
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:50,160
love each other wholeheartedly.

1100
00:27:50,220 --> 00:27:51,400
(Exactly)

1101
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:53,520
But when you're apart,

1102
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:54,760
you should still be fine on your own.

1103
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,600
That doesn't mean I love him any less

1104
00:27:57,600 --> 00:28:00,080
or that I don't love being close to him.

1105
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:00,960
If my husband

1106
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:02,280
chose this too,

1107
00:28:02,280 --> 00:28:03,680
I'd be happy.

1108
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:05,080
It's the idea of, "I love you,"

1109
00:28:05,080 --> 00:28:06,440
(I love you, but you're still free)
"but you're still free".

1110
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:09,080
Right.

1111
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,880
That was so well put.

1112
00:28:12,040 --> 00:28:13,800
You sound so well-adjusted.

1113
00:28:13,800 --> 00:28:15,120
Maybe it's because

1114
00:28:15,120 --> 00:28:16,400
I'm older now.

1115
00:28:17,440 --> 00:28:19,200
You're still young.

1116
00:28:19,300 --> 00:28:21,260
(Happy)

1117
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:22,680
A young girl.

1118
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:25,880
I picked

1119
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,880
secure, committed love.

1120
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:28,120
Who else

1121
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:28,640
picked

1122
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,800
the yellow card?

1123
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:30,320
Me.

1124
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:31,560
Me.

1125
00:28:31,560 --> 00:28:32,500
(Du Haitao, Hou Zhuocheng:
Secure Love)

1126
00:28:34,040 --> 00:28:34,640
I used to be

1127
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:36,920
(Insecure)
really insecure.

1128
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:37,840
I always needed

1129
00:28:37,840 --> 00:28:38,720
to know where she was.

1130
00:28:38,720 --> 00:28:39,680
Just feeling

1131
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:41,000
that she was there

1132
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:42,120
reassured me.

1133
00:28:42,440 --> 00:28:43,640
Whenever she went out,

1134
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:44,000
I'd get

1135
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,040
really worried

1136
00:28:45,040 --> 00:28:46,440
and keep texting her things like,

1137
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,360
"Where are you?"

1138
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:48,880
"Is everything okay?"

1139
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:49,600
"Stay safe."

1140
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:50,520
So now,

1141
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:52,000
(Front-row shipping)
whenever she takes a taxi,

1142
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:52,800
as soon as she gets in,

1143
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:54,440
she shares the ride with me.

1144
00:28:55,080 --> 00:28:56,320
Then I can track

1145
00:28:56,320 --> 00:28:56,800
the ride

1146
00:28:56,800 --> 00:28:57,800
(At ease)
and see when she arrives

1147
00:28:57,800 --> 00:28:58,240
and all that.

1148
00:28:58,840 --> 00:28:59,480
Sometimes,

1149
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:01,320
when I'm having dinner
at my best friend's place,

1150
00:29:01,320 --> 00:29:01,960
he would send us

1151
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:02,760
fresh fruit

1152
00:29:02,760 --> 00:29:04,720
or snacks.

1153
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:06,360
I think

1154
00:29:06,360 --> 00:29:07,960
he chose that answer
because he's someone

1155
00:29:07,960 --> 00:29:09,200
who values his promises deeply.

1156
00:29:10,420 --> 00:29:11,200
(Shy)

1157
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:11,960
Back on the night

1158
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:13,440
he confessed,

1159
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:15,040
he said,

1160
00:29:15,040 --> 00:29:16,080
"I'd like to invite you"

1161
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:17,080
"to be part of my life."

1162
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,000
Yes.

1163
00:29:18,320 --> 00:29:20,240
I think those words carry
a great deal of weight.

1164
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,600
After all, you'd only just met.

1165
00:29:21,600 --> 00:29:24,200
Yet over the past three years,

1166
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:26,080
he has kept that promise
every single day.

1167
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,280
He makes you

1168
00:29:29,280 --> 00:29:30,760
feel completely at ease.

1169
00:29:30,760 --> 00:29:31,600
(An overwhelming sense of security)
So touching.

1170
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,480
So,

1171
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:33,480
when he invited me

1172
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:34,240
to be part of his life,

1173
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:36,560
I was willing to join him
on that journey.

1174
00:29:38,080 --> 00:29:38,680
Dai Xu.

1175
00:29:39,500 --> 00:29:40,520
(You understand me)

1176
00:29:40,520 --> 00:29:40,880
I'm hooked.

1177
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,880
It's almost unbearably sweet.

1178
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:42,720
No...

1179
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:43,400
It's too sweet.

